Cell["\<\
The arithmetic did not suddenly become magic. The scale became enormous. \
Every quantity in the right-hand column is produced by the same handful of \
operations used above \[LongDash] matrix multiplication, softmax, \
cross-entropy, gradients, gradient descent \[LongDash] repeated over far more \
parameters, far more data, and far more training steps, and (per Section 16's \
introduction and Section \"What we left out\" above) combined with additional \
architectural components we deliberately omitted here: LayerNorm, residual \
connections, multi-head attention, larger feed-forward networks, positional \
encodings, and more. A real system is not simply this exact toy multiplied \
larger \[LongDash] it is this mechanism plus those additional pieces, at a \
scale where hand computation is impossible and was never the goal.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"524ea778-4b58-4734-b317-2abbe83c2d57"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Interactive: What Happens If I Change This Number?", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b21583c7-2853-40cd-bf58-a544d89e98d2"],

Cell["\<\
The three controls below let you perturb the trained model along three \
different axes: the learning rate used for the update, one specific output \
weight (WOut[[1,4]], the weight from h's first coordinate into \"shoe\"'s \
logit, before any training update is applied), and one specific embedding \
coordinate (the second coordinate of \"casing\"'s embedding, which feeds \
directly into X, Q, K, V, and everything downstream). Moving any slider \
recomputes the entire forward pass from scratch and redraws the attention \
weights, the next-token probability bar chart, P(\"shoe\"), and the loss.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"96471ce9-d527-4025-8aab-a29674d4065a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Manipulate", "[", "\n", "  ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "emb", ",", " ", "xLoc", ",", " ", "qLoc", ",", " ", "kLoc", ",", " ", 
       "vLoc", ",", " ", "rawLoc", ",", " ", "scaledLoc", ",", " ", 
       "maskedLoc", ",", " ", "attnLoc", ",", "\n", "    ", "attnOutLoc", ",",
        " ", "hLoc", ",", " ", "wOutLoc", ",", " ", "logitsLoc", ",", " ", 
       "probsLoc", ",", " ", "pShoeLoc", ",", " ", "lossLoc"}], "}"}], ",", 
     "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"emb", " ", "=", " ", "EmbeddingMatrix"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"emb", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "=", " ", 
       "casingCoord2"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"xLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"emb", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "tokenIDs", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"qLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"xLoc", ".", "WQ"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"kLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"xLoc", ".", "WK"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"vLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"xLoc", ".", "WV"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"rawLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"qLoc", ".", 
        RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "kLoc", "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"scaledLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"N", "[", 
        RowBox[{"rawLoc", "/", 
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"maskedLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"scaledLoc", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"-", "Infinity"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"scaledLoc", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"scaledLoc", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";",
       "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"attnLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"SoftmaxRow", " ", "/@", " ", "maskedLoc"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"attnOutLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"attnLoc", ".", "vLoc"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"hLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"attnOutLoc", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"wOutLoc", " ", "=", " ", "WOut"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"wOutLoc", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "=", " ", 
       "wOut14"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"logitsLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"hLoc", ".", "wOutLoc"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"probsLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Softmax2", "[", "logitsLoc", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"pShoeLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"probsLoc", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "targetIndex", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"lossLoc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"Log", "[", "pShoeLoc", "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", "\n", "     ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            
            RowBox[{"\"\<attention weights (row 2, \\\"casing\\\")\>\"", ",", 
             "\n", "        ", 
             RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"attnLoc", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "}"}], 
          "]"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"BarChart", "[", 
          RowBox[{"probsLoc", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ChartLabels", " ", "->", " ", "Vocabulary"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ChartStyle", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Pastel\>\""}], ",", 
           "\n", "      ", 
           RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", 
